The contents of this directory:
1) object files for our component of the video library
2) source code used to build the ffmpeg component of the video library

NOTE: The primary video library is a shared library (.dll or .so) in the library directory. 
In this directory we've provided the object files for our component of the video 
library, as well as the source code for the FFMPEG library. This can be used to 
seperately upgrade FFMPEG or to build with a static link (using libavcodec.a, libavutil.a,
and libavutil.a).